        "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Anju Korean Tapas – Modern Korean Tapas Experience</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Anju Korean Tapas offers authentic Korean tapas in a modern setting. Enjoy fresh, flavorful dishes with an emerald-themed ambiance.\"><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f4f4;color:#333}header{position:relative;width:100%;height:60vh;overflow:hidden}header img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}section{padding:2rem 1rem}h1,h2{color:#006400}h2{margin-top:0}p{line-height:1.6}#why{background:#e0f7e9;padding:1rem 0;text-align:center}#services{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.1);flex:1 1 calc(33.333% - 1rem);display:flex;flex-direction:column}card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-top-left-radius:8px;border-top-right-radius:8px}card h3{margin:1rem}card p{flex:1;margin:0 1rem 1rem}#gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:1rem}#gallery img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px}#cta{background:#006400;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:1.5rem 0;margin:2rem 0}#cta a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}#contact{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;max-width:600px;margin:auto}#contact form{display:flex;flex-direction:column}#contact input,#contact textarea{margin-bottom:1rem;padding:.5rem;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px}#contact button{background:#006400;color:#fff;border:none;padding:.75rem;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;text-align:center;padding:1rem 0;font-size:.9rem}</style></head><body><header><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas/1600/900\" alt=\"Anju Korean Tapas\"></header><section id=\"why\"><h2>Why Anju Korean Tapas?</h2><p>Experience the vibrant flavors of Korea in a modern, emerald-themed setting.</p></section><section id=\"services\"><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-1/800/600\" alt=\"Service 1\"><h3>Signature Dishes</h3><p>Delicious, authentic Korean tapas crafted with fresh ingredients.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-2/800/600\" alt=\"Service 2\"><h3>Cozy Ambiance</h3><p>Modern décor with an emerald touch for a relaxed dining experience.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-3/800/600\" alt=\"Service 3\"><h3>Live Music</h3><p>Enjoy live performances while savoring your favorite dishes.</p></div></section><section id=\"gallery\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-1/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 1\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-2/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 2\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/anju-korean-tapas-3/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 3\"></section><section id=\"cta\"><h2>Ready to Taste?</h2><p>Call us now for reservations or inquiries.</p><a href=\"tel:+1234567890\">+1 (234) 567-890</a></section><section id=\"contact\"><h2>Contact Us</h2><form action=\"#\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" required><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" required><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Your Message\" required></textarea><button type=\"submit\">Send Message</button></form></section><footer>&copy; 2026 Anju Korean Tapas. All rights reserved.</footer></body></html>",
