        "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Lakeside Dental Studio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lakeside Dental Studio — a professional website built to turn visitors into customers.\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;background:#f8fafc;line-height:1.55}.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#0b1220;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;padding:10px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.nav .brand{color:#fff;font-weight:800;margin-right:auto;font-size:1.05rem}.nav-a{color:#cbd5e1;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 13px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}.nav-a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:#fff}.nav-a.active{background:#22c55e;color:#06281a}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:30px 20px}input,textarea{font:inherit}footer{background:#0b1220;color:#cbd5e1;text-align:center;padding:20px;font-size:.9rem}</style></head><body><nav class=\"nav\"><span class=\"brand\">Lakeside Dental Studio</span><a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-a active\" onclick=\"return showPage(0)\">Home</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-a\" onclick=\"return showPage(1)\">About</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-a\" onclick=\"return showPage(2)\">Services</a></nav><section class=\"pg\" id=\"pg-0\"><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;color:#333}h1,h2,h3{color:#004d40}button{background:#004d40;color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#00332b}section{padding:60px 20px}section.hero{background:url(https://picsum.photos/seed/dentist/1600/900) center/cover no-repeat;height:60vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;text-align:center}section.hero h1{font-size:3rem;margin:0}section.hero button{margin-top:20px}section.intro{max-width:800px;margin:auto;text-align:center}section.highlights{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;margin-top:40px}section.highlights div{flex:1;max-width:200px;text-align:center}section.gallery{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;margin-top:40px}section.gallery img{height:200px;margin-right:10px;border-radius:8px}section.about{max-width:800px;margin:auto}section.values{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;margin-top:40px}section.values div{flex:1;max-width:200px;text-align:center}section.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:40px}section.packages{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;margin-top:40px}section.packages div{flex:1;max-width:250px;text-align:center;background:#e0f2f1;padding:20px;border-radius:8px}section.packages h3{margin-top:0}section.packages button{margin-top:10px}</style>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<h1>Lakeside Dental Studio</h1>\n<button>Book an Appointment</button>\n</section>\n<section class=\"intro\">\n<p>Modern dental care with a personal touch. Experience the emerald calm of Lakeside Dental Studio.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"highlights\">\n<div>\n<h3>State‑of‑the‑Art</h3>\n<p>Advanced technology for precise care.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Comfort First</h3>\n<p>Relaxing environment and friendly staff.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Personalized Plans</h3>\n<p>Tailored treatments for every smile.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"gallery\">\n<img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/dentist-1/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 1\">\n<img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/dentist-2/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 2\">\n<img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/dentist-3/800/600\" alt=\"Gallery 3\">\n</section></section>\n<section class=\"pg\" id=\"pg-1\" style=\"display:none\"><section class=\"about\">\n<h2>Our Story</h2>\n<p>Founded by Dr. Elena Rivera, Lakeside Dental Studio blends modern techniques with compassionate care. We grew from a small practice into a community hub for healthy smiles.</p>\n<h2>Why Choose Us</h2>\n<p>Our commitment to continuous learning, patient education, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart.</p>\n<h2>Trust Points</h2>\n<p>• 15+ years of experience<br>• 4.9/5 patient rating<br>• Accredited by the American Dental Association</p>\n<h2>Values & Team</h2>\n<div class=\"values\">\n<div>\n<h3>Integrity</h3>\n<p>Transparent communication and honest care.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Innovation</h3>\n<p>Adopting the latest dental advancements.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Compassion</h3>\n<p>Patient‑first approach in every visit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></section>\n<section class=\"pg\" id=\"pg-2\" style=\"display:none\"><section class=\"services-grid\">\n<div>\n<h3>General Dentistry</h3>\n<p>Comprehensive exams, cleanings, and preventive care.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Cosmetic Dentistry</h3>\n<p>Whitening, veneers, and smile design.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Orthodontics</h3>\n<p>Invisalign and traditional braces for all ages.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Restorative Dentistry</h3>\n<p>Fillings, crowns, and dental implants.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Periodontics</h3>\n<p>Advanced gum care and treatments.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Emergency Care</h3>\n<p>Rapid response for urgent dental issues.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"packages\">\n<div>\n<h3>Basic Care</h3>\n<p>Annual exam + cleaning.</p>\n<button>$120</button>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Smile Makeover</h3>\n<p>Whitening + veneers.</p>\n<button>$850</button>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>Full Restore</h3>\n<p>Implants + crowns.</p>\n<button>$2,500</button>\n</div>\n</section></section><footer>© 2026 Lakeside Dental Studio. All rights reserved.</footer><script>function showPage(i){document.querySelectorAll('.pg').forEach(function(s,idx){s.style.display=idx===i?'block':'none'});document.querySelectorAll('.nav-a').forEach(function(a,idx){a.classList.toggle('active',idx===i)});window.scrollTo(0,0);return false;}</script></body></html>",
