        "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>ACME Roofing</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"ACME Roofing — a professional website built to turn visitors into customers.\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;color:#fff7ed;background:#1c0a00;line-height:1.55}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:#1c0a00;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;padding:10px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap;box-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(15,23,42,.08);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}.nav-a{color:#fdba74;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:8px 13px;border-radius:9px;font-size:.9rem}.nav-a.active,.nav-a:hover{background:#f97316;color:#1c0a00}.nav .brand{font-weight:800;margin-right:auto;font-size:1.02rem}.pg{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 20px 40px}.site-foot{background:#1c0a00;color:#fdba74;text-align:center;padding:24px;font-size:.88rem}form.site-form{display:grid;gap:10px;max-width:520px}input,textarea,select{padding:12px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:10px;font:inherit;width:100%}button{cursor:pointer}</style></head><body><nav class=\"nav\"><span class=\"brand\">ACME Roofing</span><a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-a active\" onclick=\"return showPage(0)\">Home</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-a\" onclick=\"return showPage(1)\">About</a></nav><section class=\"pg\" id=\"pg-0\"><style>\n.acme-roofing-home-hero{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2rem;margin:4rem 0;}\n.acme-roofing-home-hero h1{font-size:3rem;flex:1;}\n.acme-roofing-home-hero a{background:emerald;color:#fff;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;border-radius:9999px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:1rem;display:inline-block;}\n.acme-roofing-home-stats{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;margin:2rem 0;}\n.acme-roofing-home-card{box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);padding:2rem;border-radius:1rem;background:#fff;margin:1rem;width:30%;}\n.acme-roofing-home-card a{color:emerald;text-decoration:none;}\n.acme-roofing-home-form{margin-top:2rem;padding:2rem;background:#fff;border-radius:1rem;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"acme-roofing-home-hero\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>ACME Roofing – <span style=\"border-bottom:4px solid emerald;\">Reliable Roof Solutions</span></h1>\n    <p>Your trusted roofing partner in Ikeja.</p>\n    <a href=\"#contact\">Get a Quote</a>\n    <a href=\"#services\">Our Services</a>\n  </div>\n  <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/roofing-contractor/1600/900\" alt=\"Roofing crew\" style=\"border-radius:1rem;max-width:50%;\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"acme-roofing-home-stats\">\n  <div><strong>10k+</strong> Projects</div>\n  <div><strong>20+</strong> Years</div>\n  <div><strong>5</strong> Awards</div>\n  <div><strong>1k</strong> Happy Clients</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;\">\n  <div class=\"acme-roofing-home-card\">\n    <h3>Residential Roofing</h3>\n    <p>Custom designs for homes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#residential\">Learn More</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"acme-roofing-home-card\">\n    <h3>Commercial Services</h3>\n    <p>Durable solutions for businesses.</p>\n    <a href=\"#commercial\">Learn More</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"acme-roofing-home-card\">\n    <h3>Emergency Repair</h3>\n    <p>24/7 rapid response.</p>\n    <a href=\"#emergency\">Learn More</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/roofing-contractor-1/800/600\" alt=\"Roof repair\" style=\"display:block;margin:2rem auto;width:80%;border-radius:1rem;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">Expert craftsmanship ensuring lasting protection.</p>\n<details><summary>What roofing materials do you use?</summary>We offer shingles, metal, tile, and flat roof systems tailored to your needs.</details>\n<details><summary>Do you provide warranties?</summary>All installations come with a 10-year workmanship warranty.</details>\n<details><summary>How quickly can you respond?</summary>We typically respond within 24 hours for new inquiries.</details>\n<form class=\"acme-roofing-home-form\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n  <label>Name: <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required></label><br><br>\n  <label>Email: <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required></label><br><br>\n  <label>Phone: <input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" required></label><br><br>\n  <label>Message:<br><textarea name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" required></textarea></label><br><br>\n  <button type=\"submit\" style=\"background:emerald;color:#fff;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;border:none;border-radius:9999px;\">Send Message</button>\n</form></section><section class=\"pg\" id=\"pg-1\" style=\"display:none\"><style>\n.acme-roofing-about-hero{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:4rem 2rem;background:#fff;}\n.acme-roofing-about-hero h1{font-size:3rem;margin:0 0 1rem 0;font-weight:700;color:#004d40;}\n.acme-roofing-about-hero h1 .accent{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;}\n.acme-roofing-about-hero .buttons{display:flex;gap:1rem;}\n.acme-roofing-about-hero .buttons a{background:#004d40;color:#fff;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;border-radius:9999px;text-decoration:none;}\n.acme-roofing-about-stats{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:3rem 0;background:#e0f2f1;}\n.acme-roofing-about-stats .stat{font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:#004d40;}\n.acme-roofing-about-cards{display:flex;gap:2rem;padding:3rem 2rem;}\n.acme-roofing-about-card{flex:1;padding:2rem;border-radius:1rem;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);}\n.acme-roofing-about-card h3{margin-top:0;color:#004d40;}\n.acme-roofing-about-card a{color:#004d40;text-decoration:underline;}\n.acme-roofing-about-image{text-align:center;padding:3rem 2rem;}\n.acme-roofing-about-image img{max-width:100%;border-radius:1rem;}\n.acme-roofing-about-faq details{margin:1rem 0;}\n.acme-roofing-about-form{padding:3rem 2rem;background:#e0f2f1;}\n.acme-roofing-about-form input,.acme-roofing-about-form textarea{display:block;width:100%;margin-bottom:1rem;padding:.75rem;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:.5rem;}\n.acme-roofing-about-form button{background:#004d40;color:#fff;padding:.75rem 1.5rem;border:none;border-radius:.5rem;}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-hero\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>Our <span class=\"accent\">Story</span></h1>\n    <p>From humble beginnings to modern excellence, ACME Roofing has built roofs that stand the test of time.</p>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Contact Us</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Learn More</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/roofing-contractor/1600/900\" alt=\"Roofing\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-stats\">\n  <div class=\"stat\">5k+</div>\n  <div class=\"stat\">12 Years</div>\n  <div class=\"stat\">1,200+</div>\n  <div class=\"stat\">100%</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-cards\">\n  <article class=\"acme-roofing-about-card\">\n    <h3>Quality Materials</h3>\n    <p>We source only the best.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"acme-roofing-about-card\">\n    <h3>Expert Team</h3>\n    <p>Skilled and certified.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"acme-roofing-about-card\">\n    <h3>Customer Focus</h3>\n    <p>Your satisfaction first.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\">Read More</a>\n  </article>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-image\">\n  <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/roofing-contractor-1/800/600\" alt=\"Our Work\">\n  <p>Transforming homes with precision and care.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-faq\">\n  <details>\n    <summary>What services do you offer?</summary>\n    <p>Full roof installation, repair, and maintenance.</p>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>Do you provide warranties?</summary>\n    <p>Yes, we offer a 10-year workmanship guarantee.</p>\n  </details>\n  <details>\n    <summary>How long does a project take?</summary>\n    <p>Typically 2-4 weeks depending on size.</p>\n  </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"acme-roofing-about-form\">\n  <form>\n    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Name\" required>\n    <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" required>\n    <input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Phone\" required>\n    <textarea placeholder=\"Message\" rows=\"4\" required></textarea>\n    <button type=\"submit\">Send Message</button>\n  </form>\n</section></section><footer>© 2026 ACME Roofing. All rights reserved.<br><span style=\"opacity:.75;font-size:.82rem\">Website crafted with MAT LEADS AI Website Studio — created by Ebube John Okoye.</span></footer><script>function showPage(i){document.querySelectorAll('.pg').forEach(function(s,idx){s.style.display=idx===i?'block':'none'});document.querySelectorAll('.nav-a').forEach(function(a,idx){a.classList.toggle('active',idx===i)});window.scrollTo(0,0);return false;}</script></body></html>",
